{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-bebbb3caba34","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-bebbb3caba34","name":"油酥","category":"condiment","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/condiment/%E6%B2%B9%E9%85%A5.md","blob_sha":"83bf148326a2a00539e11eaa73ff37b441a40c9f","details":{"introduction":"这是一道中式面点配料，常用于烙饼，能让成品层次分明、外酥里软。主要提供碳水化合物和脂肪，为身体补充能量。做法十分简单，新手友好，预计只需 3 分钟就能调好。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 面粉\n- 油\n- 盐"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 油 = （要烙饼的张数 * 10ml）\n- 盐 = （要烙饼的张数 / 2）g\n- 面粉 = （要烙饼的张数 / 0.13）g"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 面粉盛小碗里，加入盐\n2. 加入 200 度的热油\n3. 用筷子将其搅拌成无固状物体的糊状。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：通用小麦面粉70g、大豆食用油50g；整份约120g。面粉和大豆油标准，油全部留在油酥中。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":580.666667,"protein_g":6.008333,"carbohydrate_g":44.508333,"fat_g":42.238333},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169761/nutrients","version":"47cd97d7a4d0b685","fdc_ids":[169761,171411]},"profile_id":"family-bebbb3caba34-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-bebbb3caba34","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-bebbb3caba34","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"stir_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-bebbb3caba34-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"flour","grams":70},{"key":"oil","grams":50}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"47cd97d7a4d0b685","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-bebbb3caba34-v1.50b544a29efa51e5.json","bytes":13864,"sha256":"50b544a29ef